{
  "page": 523,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4727,
      "text": "Demikianlah setiap kali seorang rasul yang datang kepada orang-orang yang sebelum mereka, mereka (kaumnya) pasti mengatakan, \"Dia itu penyihir atau orang gila.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4728,
      "text": "Apakah mereka saling berpesan tentang apa yang dikatakan itu. Sebenarnya mereka adalah kaum yang melampaui batas.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4729,
      "text": "Maka berpalinglah engkau dari mereka, dan engkau sama sekali tidak tercela.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4730,
      "text": "Dan tetaplah memberi peringatan, karena sesungguhnya peringatan itu bermanfaat bagi orang-orang mukmin.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 55,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4731,
      "text": "Aku tidak menciptakan jin dan manusia melainkan agar mereka beribadah kepada-Ku.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4732,
      "text": "Aku tidak menghendaki rezeki sedikit pun dari mereka dan Aku tidak menghendaki agar mereka memberi makan kepada-Ku.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 57,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4733,
      "text": "Sungguh Allah, Dialah Pemberi rezeki yang mempunyai kekuatan lagi sangat kokoh.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 58,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4734,
      "text": "Maka sungguh, untuk orang-orang yang zalim ada bagian (azab) seperti bagian teman-teman mereka (dahulu); maka janganlah mereka meminta kepada-Ku untuk menyegerakannya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 59,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4735,
      "text": "Maka celakalah orang-orang yang kafir pada hari yang telah dijanjikan kepada mereka (hari Kiamat).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 60,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4736,
      "text": "Demi gunung (Sinai),",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4737,
      "text": "dan demi Kitab yang ditulis,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4738,
      "text": "pada lembaran yang terbuka,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4739,
      "text": "demi Baitulma'mur,[815]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 523,
      "ruku": 458,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4740,
      "text": "demi atap yang ditinggikan (langit),",
      "surah": {
        "number": 52,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الطُّورِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tur",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Mount",
        "numberOfAyahs": 49,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 27,
